      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXCESS BAGGAGE (3) missed in a photo first-up before winning in a photo last start at this track and trip. Should be at her peak fitness now third-up and she still has plenty of upside. Can lob off the speed and come with a barnstorming finish once more. NICCIMOTA (1) was too good from up on the speed last start, working across from out wide and being too speedy. This shapes nicely again from a better draw this time and Cooper's claim is a bonus. Can bring up back-to-back wins. DAWN DANCER (8) comes here off a short freshen and a recent trial win. He went back-to-back before the break and looks primed on the back of that recent trial. He's a speedy customer who'll give a bold sight with no weight on his back. ETERNAL WINE (6) gets Pike on board now after finishing behind Niccimoto last time. Won't be far away. CANNYKEV (2) can resume on a positive note.",
